<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> and the others had invited me out; I turned them down, and lay face down on the bed in my room.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">How long had I kept this position?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Today was a morning-only schedule, nothing but the entrance ceremony, so I wrung out what willpower I had left so as not to end up in the nurse's room―</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Swaying, I walked from the school and finally reached home.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">An hour since I collapsed onto the bed, no, 3 hours, perhaps.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was nearly the hour when the orange evening sun dyes the room.</STYLE><PG>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> and the others, what were they doing now?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2" RUBY="ごとう">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was surely enjoying the food-stall menu, things like yakisoba and karaage.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I was grateful for the invitation to the festival, but for me the Cherry Blossom Festival is suicide.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's not that I want to deny the way everyone admires the cherry blossoms.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">April has only just begun, and there must be plenty of people bubbling over about their new lives.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, maybe there are plenty of people who turn gloomy at this time of year too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There must be plenty of people whose living environment has changed and who find that stressful.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But in my case, it's different from that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The cherry blossoms―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">When the season comes for the cherry blossoms to bloom, I―</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Through the open window, along with the breeze, came the outside </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="けんそう">din</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Now and then a child's voice, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">now and then the sound of a car, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">now and then the sound of the wind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And then...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "500" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\インターホン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The intercom.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Getting up was too much </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="おっくう">trouble</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I thought about pretending not to be home, but...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
