{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">When I opened the door, a high-school girl with short hair was standing there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just as I thought: </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "イエローカメラ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Hey! How're you doing?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah... so-so, I guess."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">To that cheerful greeting, unchanged as ever, I answered with something like a forced smile.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The corners of my mouth wouldn't go up properly.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Hmm... so the April sickness isn't any better this year either, huh."</STYLE> [TN: coined against the real Japanese term for a slump after a new start, the May blues.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Well, it happens every year, so I'm used to it by now."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Over here, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2" RUBY="ごとう">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> ate her way through one stall after another and it was rough. Saying 'Operation start!' again. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">What does she think my wallet is..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even as she said that, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> spoke happily.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Heh! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2" RUBY="ごとう">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> is small and still a big eater, isn't she? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Where does all that food go?"</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "53" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"My own stomach's been off since yesterday, so I kept it to nibbling. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">So, here. A souvenir!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\ビニール.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I was handed a plastic bag, neither large nor small.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"It's takoyaki, so eat it while it's hot. See ya!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "1000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関閉.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\靴足音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Not long after our door closed, the sound of the door next to it opening and closing spread dully along the outside walkway.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> left at a quick pace, but it was probably because she was worried about the strain on my body.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Making </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> take this much trouble over me has become the routine work of this time of year, every year.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I let out another big sigh, picked up the plastic bag and went back to my room.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
