Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> calls this gloomy mood of mine </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="しがつびょう">April sickness</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In cherry-blossom season, just like the May blues, I sink into a gloom.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I don't really understand it, but apparently my constitution just won't accept cherry blossoms.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For me, early April is nothing but pain.</STYLE><PG>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1">'s face made me feel a little better, I thought.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And then, perhaps because the tension had loosened, a comfortable sleepiness brushed at my eyes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'll sleep while I can, even a little. My mind and my body must both be tired.</STYLE><PG>
