{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Coming."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I sat up in the pitch-dark room.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Thanks to the rest, maybe, my body seems to be doing better.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But, I'm awfully sleepy...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe I dreamed something; it feels like my sleep was shallow.</STYLE><PG>
