<STYLE ID="1">In the kitchen, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was getting dinner ready.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In the living room... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Nobody there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> didn't seem to be home yet.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Because of the stir-frying, maybe, the window had been opened, and the night breeze was blowing into the room.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\台所1.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
