{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Morning. How are you feeling?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was cooking with her back to me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Mmm... better than at noon, I guess."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Do you think you can eat?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah, I'll eat properly today. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> not back yet?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"He said he suddenly got a business trip to Hokkaido. He's not back until next week, apparently."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s business trips are always sudden, aren't they?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is apparently an engineer for cell phone equipment, but the moment he got a bit of a promotion he started being sent away on business all over the place.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For my part, it's a little lonely.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s not here, huh. And I was looking forward to eating the takoyaki together."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Takoyaki?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\ビニール.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> gave it to me. A get-well present."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I handed the bag to </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Always, always, I feel bad about </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">-chan. I'll have to thank her later."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah... really. I'll thank her properly later."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> are both very fond of </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, truly</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電子レンジ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> put the takoyaki in the microwave and, in the meantime, was moving the stir-fry from the frying pan onto a plate.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I have no appetite, but if it's takoyaki </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> gave me, I think I can manage.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Sorry for the wait. Now then, let's eat."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Rice and miso soup, and then dried horse mackerel and kinpira gobo.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">To this plain table, takoyaki was added.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\たこ焼き桜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Ah..."</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Ah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">On the surface of the takoyaki sat </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="ひとひら">a single</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> cherry petal.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Sorry, I'll take it off right away..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s face clouded over.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But, for me there was no option of not eating it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Just because I hate cherry blossoms, to refuse </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s get-well gift.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"I-it's fine! Not eating over a little thing like this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I used my </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="はし">chopsticks</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> to lift the takoyaki.</STYLE><PG>
