<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPS>"Ugh... guhh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>I ran into the toilet and crouched down, hunched over the bowl.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPS>"Ngh... gehh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>Nothing came out of my empty stomach.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And yet, violent nausea and dizziness </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="さいな">tormented</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> me.</STYLE><PG>
