<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>This is nothing much.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It's the usual thing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This is the April sickness that comes to me every year.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Strictly speaking, maybe you'd call it cherry-blossom phobia.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ever since I was old enough to remember, I've had this kind of physical trouble at this time of year.</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "19" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">So I'm used to it by now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'm used to the symptoms.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But, the cherry blossoms are the one thing I can't get used to.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\haa1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Haah... haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Steady my breathing, calm my feelings.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A little better now, maybe.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I thought the nap had made me better, but give it a trigger and this is what happens.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even if it was something </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> gave me, maybe I pushed myself a little too far...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
