{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Are you all right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was sitting on the living-room sofa, gripping her cell phone in her hand.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s cell phone is an old flip phone that has been in use for about 10 years now.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah, I'm all right now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"I see... well, that's good then..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was oddly fidgety.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">She was perched on the edge of the sofa, not pressing any button on the cell phone, just scratching at its surface with a fingernail.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"What's wrong? Did something happen?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Huh? No... it's nothing..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"More to the point, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, you're the one who should eat at least some rice gruel. I'll get it ready."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah, thank you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> put the cell phone in her pocket and headed for the kitchen.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">This time it was my turn to sit down on the sofa.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Through the window that had been left open, a slightly cold wind blew in.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For clearing the dizziness, this was about right, but it was a little cold.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\small_window_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">The cooking was finished anyway, so I closed the window.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And at once my mind began to settle.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">As if taking advantage of that, the same sleepiness as in the afternoon tried to sit down on my eyelids again.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">What is it, I'm terribly sleepy today.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even after that much of a nap earlier.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But I feel like I had some kind of frightening dream. I don't really have the sense of having slept.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Maybe I'll eat the rice gruel and turn in early.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, but I have to get in the bath.</STYLE><PG>
