<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"What are you talking about, swaying about like that. Sit down and stay put."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"But, I feel like moving my body a bit makes it easier. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">April sickness is a matter of mood, I think. I'll go and do it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Well then, maybe I'll let you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
